                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health's Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended listing ciclosporin (CsA) 0.1% eye drops on the MOH List of Subsidised Drugs for treating severe vernal keratoconjunctivitis due to the uncertain clinical and cost effectiveness compared with current standard of care."
